{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01251","headline":"相和歌辞 安乐宫 · 李贺","name":"相和歌辞 安乐宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深井桐乌起，尚复牵清水。\n未盥邵陵王，瓶中弄长翠。\n新城安乐宫，宫如凤皇翅。\n歌回蜡版鸣，大绾提壶使。\n绿繁悲水曲，茱萸别秋子。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}